msgid "=== \"Existing CANN environment\""
msgstr "=== \"现有CANN环境\""

msgid ""
"#### Install in an existing CANN environment {: #installation-existing-cann "
"}"
msgstr "#### 在现有CANN环境中安装 {: #installation-existing-cann }"

msgid ""
"This path applies to an official CANN base image or to CANN that is already "
"installed on the host or in an existing container."
msgstr "此路径适用于官方CANN基础镜像，或已安装在主机或现有容器中的CANN。"

msgid ""
"##### Prepare the CANN environment {: #installation-existing-cann-prepare }"
msgstr "##### 准备CANN环境 {: #installation-existing-cann-prepare }"

msgid "=== \"CANN base image\""
msgstr "=== \"CANN基础镜像\""

msgid "| Hardware | Recommended Ubuntu CANN base image |"
msgstr "| 硬件 | 推荐的Ubuntu CANN基础镜像 |"

msgid ""
"        | Ascend A2 series products | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ "
"release_cann_version }}-910b-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"
msgstr ""
"        | Ascend A2系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ release_cann_version "
"}}-910b-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"

msgid ""
"        | Ascend A3 series products | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ "
"release_cann_version }}-a3-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"
msgstr ""
"        | Ascend A3系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ release_cann_version "
"}}-a3-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"

msgid ""
"        | Ascend 310P series products | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ "
"release_cann_version }}-310p-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"
msgstr ""
"        | Ascend 310P系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ release_cann_version "
"}}-310p-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"

msgid ""
"        | Ascend 950DT series products | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ "
"release_cann_version }}-950-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"
msgstr ""
"        | Ascend 950DT系列产品 | `quay.io/ascend/cann:{{ release_cann_version "
"}}-950-ubuntu22.04-py3.12` |"

msgid ""
"The CANN base image already includes the Toolkit, the operator package for "
"the target hardware, and NNAL. You do not need to reinstall CANN in the "
"container. For other operating systems and tags, see the [CANN Container "
"Images Overview](https://github.com/Ascend/cann-container-"
"image/blob/main/OVERVIEW.md)."
msgstr ""
"CANN基础镜像已包含Toolkit、目标硬件的算子包以及NNAL。您无需在容器中重新安装CANN。有关其他操作系统和标签，请参阅[CANN容器镜像概述](https://github.com/Ascend/cann-"
"container-image/blob/main/OVERVIEW.md)。"

msgid "???+ warning \"The container command below uses A2 as an example\""
msgstr "???+ warning \"以下容器命令以A2为例\""

msgid ""
"The device nodes and host driver mounts in the following example apply to "
"A2."
msgstr "以下示例中的设备节点和主机驱动挂载适用于A2。"

msgid ""
"A3, 310P, and 950DT must use device nodes and host driver mounts that match "
"the hardware. Refer to the container startup commands for "
"[A3](quick_start.md#quick-start-atlas-a3-container), [Atlas 300I "
"DUO](quick_start.md#quick-start-atlas-300i-duo-container), [310P "
"SOC](quick_start.md#quick-start-310p-soc-container), and "
"[950DT](quick_start.md#quick-start-atlas-950dt-container) in the Quick "
"Start."
msgstr ""
"A3、310P和950DT必须使用与硬件匹配的设备节点和主机驱动挂载。请参阅快速入门中的[A3](quick_start.md#quick-start-"
"atlas-a3-container)、[Atlas 300I DUO](quick_start.md#quick-start-"
"atlas-300i-duo-container)、[310P SOC](quick_start.md#quick-start-310p-soc-"
"container)和[950DT](quick_start.md#quick-start-atlas-950dt-container)容器启动命令。"

msgid "=== \"CANN already installed\""
msgstr "=== \"CANN已安装\""

msgid "???+ warning \"Verify the NNAL environment\""
msgstr "???+ warning \"验证NNAL环境\""

msgid ""
"Confirm that `/usr/local/Ascend/nnal/atb/set_env.sh` and `libatb.so` are "
"available. If CANN is installed elsewhere, source the corresponding "
"`set_env.sh`. If a \"libatb.so not found\" error occurs at runtime, make "
"sure that the manual installation steps installed NNAL correctly."
msgstr ""
"确认`/usr/local/Ascend/nnal/atb/set_env.sh`和`libatb.so`可用。如果CANN安装在其他位置，请source相应的`set_env.sh`。如果运行时出现\"libatb.so"
" not found\"错误，请确保手动安装步骤正确安装了NNAL。"

